# --- w1_l1_coop Vine Bridges (co-op) ---
msgid "SIGN_COOP_W1_EGG"
msgstr "Fall or get beaten and you float in an egg! Your partner hatches you with a whack, a bounce or a checkpoint fire."

msgid "SIGN_COOP_W1_HOP"
msgstr "A tablet with two cavemen: a deed for two! One stands under the ledge, the other jumps on his head holding Jump."

msgid "SIGN_COOP_W1_POT"
msgstr "Up top? Club the flower pot off the edge - it grows into a springy flower for your partner."

msgid "SIGN_COOP_W1_PLATES"
msgstr "Stand on a stone plate to hold its door open. Hold one for your partner, then he holds one for you!"

msgid "SIGN_COOP_W1_SHELL"
msgstr "Shellbacks turn their shell to the nearer caveman. One of you stands in front, the other clubs the back!"
